{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible, then approach and grab it. Move and check it. Do specific task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToTarget    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    />",
